d 'LPDDD': module to estimate stacked local-projection triple differences with a seasonal base period
d
d  Stacked local-projection triple differences with a seasonal base
d period. lpddd estimates the dynamic effect of a treatment that
d starts at different dates for different groups and affects only
d some units within a treated group. It stacks each treated cohort
d with clean control groups, runs one regression per period
d relative to treatment, and takes a triple difference (treated
d group x eligible unit). With season() each period is compared
d with the same season before treatment, and with spans() effects
d are estimated for spans of periods. A difference-in-differences
d is available with the option dd. 
d
d KW: DiD
d KW: triple difference
d KW: stacked local projections
d
d Requires: Stata version 15.1
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261126
d
d Author:   Ahmad Nawaz,   Department of Economics, University of Sahiwal, Pakistan
d Support: email ahmadnawaz@@uosahiwal.edu.pk
d
